# Downloaded by `wails build -nsis` and embedded into the installer, not written
# by anyone here. It was tracked by accident: 1.8 MB of Microsoft's WebView2
# bootstrapper, roughly half the repository, restored automatically whenever the
# installer is built. Verified by deleting it and rebuilding.
build/windows/installer/tmp/
